The digits is a list of 1, 2, 0, and 0.
The extra is 34.
The answers is an empty list of whole numbers.
The spot is the last position of digits.
The carry is extra.
Repeat while spot is at least 0 or carry is more than 0.
If spot is at least 0, The sum is item spot of digits plus carry, Place (sum modulo 10) into answers, set carry to sum divided by 10.
If spot is less than 0, Place (carry modulo 10) into answers, set carry to carry divided by 10.
Subtract 1 from spot.

The spot is the last position of answers.
Repeat while spot is at least 0.
Show item spot of answers.
Subtract 1 from spot.
